    "name": "Game Service",
    "description": "Postman Collection for testing Game Service: sessions and lobbies, the day/night cycle, and timed player actions.\n\nRun the collection in order - requests share state through collection variables. Every run creates its own sessions, so it can be run repeatedly without resetting the database.\n\nStart the service first (see game-service/README.md). Default baseUrl is http://localhost:5299.",
